# Tooth WT Model – Data and Reproducibility Notes

This directory contains the code and processed data used to generate the Tooth WT model figures presented in the manuscript.

## Repository contents

- `tooth_WT_master.ipynb` — analysis and figure-generation notebook.
- `plot_a/` — processed phenotype-frequency datasets.
- `plot_b/plot_b_data/` — processed data used to generate the entropy analyses.

## Data files

The notebook uses the following processed datasets:

### Main figures

- `plot_a/filtered_6000_opc_cusp.txt`
- `plot_a/filtered_10000_opc_cusp.txt`
- `plot_b/plot_b_data/` (all processed data files in this directory)

### Supplementary analyses

The notebook also includes analyses using alternative phenotype-frequency thresholds:

- `plot_a/filter_opcfreq1/filtered_2000_opc_cusp_nosingletons.txt`
- `plot_a/filter_opcfreq1/filtered_6000_opc_cusp_nosingletons.txt`
- `plot_a/filter_opcfreq1/filtered_10000_opc_cusp_nosingletons.txt`

and

- `plot_a/filter_opc_freq3/filtered_2000_opc_cusp_min4.txt`
- `plot_a/filter_opc_freq3/filtered_6000_opc_cusp_min4.txt`
- `plot_a/filter_opc_freq3/filtered_10000_opc_cusp_min4.txt`

These processed datasets are included in the repository and are sufficient to reproduce the analyses contained in the notebook.

## Notes

The notebook reads processed datasets directly and does not require access to the original simulation outputs.
